  "content": "<div id=\"readability-page-1\" class=\"page\"><div><div><div><p>The first agentic development environment for the mainframe.</p><p>Use AI agents to navigate TN3270, inspect datasets, write JCL, debug jobs, query VSAM, and operate inside z/OS from a modern development environment.</p></div><div><p><img alt=\"Hopper interface\" width=\"2852\" height=\"2104\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 960px\" srcset=\"https://www.hypercubic.ai/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhopper%2Fhopper_hero_img.jpg&amp;w=320&amp;q=75 320w, https://www.hypercubic.ai/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhopper%2Fhopper_hero_img.jpg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, https://www.hypercubic.ai/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhopper%2Fhopper_hero_img.jpg&amp;w=480&amp;q=75 480w, https://www.hypercubic.ai/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhopper%2Fhopper_hero_img.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, https://www.hypercubic.ai/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhopper%2Fhopper_hero_img.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, https://www.hypercubic.ai/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhopper%2Fhopper_hero_img.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, https://www.hypercubic.ai/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhopper%2Fhopper_hero_img.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, https://www.hypercubic.ai/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhopper%2Fhopper_hero_img.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, https://www.hypercubic.ai/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhopper%2Fhopper_hero_img.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, https://www.hypercubic.ai/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhopper%2Fhopper_hero_img.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, https://www.hypercubic.ai/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhopper%2Fhopper_hero_img.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"https://www.hypercubic.ai/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhopper%2Fhopper_hero_img.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"></p></div></div><div><div><h2>Need access to a mainframe?</h2><p>Fill out the form and we'll send you credentials to try Hopper on our mainframe for free.</p><p><span>Powered by</span><a href=\"https://maintec.com/?utm_source=hypercubic&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=hopper_launch&amp;utm_content=powered_by_logo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Maintec\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"85\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" srcset=\"https://www.hypercubic.ai/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fmaintec.jpg&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 1x, https://www.hypercubic.ai/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fmaintec.jpg&amp;w=480&amp;q=75 2x\" src=\"https://www.hypercubic.ai/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fmaintec.jpg&amp;w=480&amp;q=75\"></a></p></div><a href=\"https://hypercubic.fillout.com/hopper\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>Request Credentials</span></a></div><div><h2>Built by leading minds behind the world's most advanced AI and technology</h2><p>Our team unites top researchers, engineers, and strategists from pioneering companies and institutions—all focused on building systems that deliver real impact.</p></div><div><p><img alt=\"Hopper agent panel investigating a mainframe job\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"2662\" height=\"1712\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 60vw\" srcset=\"https://www.hypercubic.ai/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhopper%2Fhopper_agent.jpg&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, https://www.hypercubic.ai/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhopper%2Fhopper_agent.jpg&amp;w=320&amp;q=75 320w, https://www.hypercubic.ai/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhopper%2Fhopper_agent.jpg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, https://www.hypercubic.ai/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhopper%2Fhopper_agent.jpg&amp;w=480&amp;q=75 480w, https://www.hypercubic.ai/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhopper%2Fhopper_agent.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, https://www.hypercubic.ai/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhopper%2Fhopper_agent.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, https://www.hypercubic.ai/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhopper%2Fhopper_agent.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, https://www.hypercubic.ai/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhopper%2Fhopper_agent.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, https://www.hypercubic.ai/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhopper%2Fhopper_agent.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, https://www.hypercubic.ai/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhopper%2Fhopper_agent.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, https://www.hypercubic.ai/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhopper%2Fhopper_agent.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, https://www.hypercubic.ai/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhopper%2Fhopper_agent.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"https://www.hypercubic.ai/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhopper%2Fhopper_agent.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"></p></div><div><div><h2>Compile, test, ship in one prompt</h2><p>Drives the JCL, parses JES return codes, NEWCOPYs into CICS, and pauses for your approval before every change.</p><a href=\"https://docs.hypercubic.ai/core-concepts/tools\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn more<!-- -->&nbsp;<span></span></a></div><div><p><img alt=\"Hopper agent staging a CICSCOB1 JCL member with NEWCOPY rollout in one prompt\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"2468\" height=\"1468\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 60vw\" srcset=\"https://www.hypercubic.ai/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhopper%2Fhopper_one_prompt.jpg&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, https://www.hypercubic.ai/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhopper%2Fhopper_one_prompt.jpg&amp;w=320&amp;q=75 320w, https://www.hypercubic.ai/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhopper%2Fhopper_one_prompt.jpg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, https://www.hypercubic.ai/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhopper%2Fhopper_one_prompt.jpg&amp;w=480&amp;q=75 480w, https://www.hypercubic.ai/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhopper%2Fhopper_one_prompt.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, https://www.hypercubic.ai/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhopper%2Fhopper_one_prompt.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, https://www.hypercubic.ai/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhopper%2Fhopper_one_prompt.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, https://www.hypercubic.ai/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhopper%2Fhopper_one_prompt.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, https://www.hypercubic.ai/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhopper%2Fhopper_one_prompt.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, https://www.hypercubic.ai/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhopper%2Fhopper_one_prompt.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, https://www.hypercubic.ai/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhopper%2Fhopper_one_prompt.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, https://www.hypercubic.ai/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhopper%2Fhopper_one_prompt.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"https://www.hypercubic.ai/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhopper%2Fhopper_one_prompt.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"></p></div></div><div><div><h2>Debug failed jobs without hunting through SDSF</h2><p>Hours of SDSF triage in one @-tag. The agent decodes JESMSGLG, JESYSMSG, and SYSUDUMP into the abend code, failing step, and source line.</p><a href=\"https://docs.hypercubic.ai/core-concepts/how-hopper-works\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn more<!-- -->&nbsp;<span></span></a></div><div><p><img alt=\"Hopper agent diagnosing a failed mainframe job — user tags @JOB01945 and the agent surfaces the abend, failing step, and source line beside the SDSF spool\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"2772\" height=\"2106\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 60vw\" srcset=\"https://www.hypercubic.ai/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhopper%2Fhopper_job_at.jpg&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, https://www.hypercubic.ai/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhopper%2Fhopper_job_at.jpg&amp;w=320&amp;q=75 320w, https://www.hypercubic.ai/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhopper%2Fhopper_job_at.jpg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, https://www.hypercubic.ai/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhopper%2Fhopper_job_at.jpg&amp;w=480&amp;q=75 480w, https://www.hypercubic.ai/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhopper%2Fhopper_job_at.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, https://www.hypercubic.ai/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhopper%2Fhopper_job_at.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, https://www.hypercubic.ai/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhopper%2Fhopper_job_at.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, https://www.hypercubic.ai/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhopper%2Fhopper_job_at.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, https://www.hypercubic.ai/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhopper%2Fhopper_job_at.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, https://www.hypercubic.ai/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhopper%2Fhopper_job_at.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, https://www.hypercubic.ai/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhopper%2Fhopper_job_at.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, https://www.hypercubic.ai/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhopper%2Fhopper_job_at.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"https://www.hypercubic.ai/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhopper%2Fhopper_job_at.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"></p></div></div><div><div><h2>A real TN3270 terminal, when you need it</h2><p>Works exactly like the TN3270 you've used for years. Full PF, PA, and attention-key support.</p><a href=\"https://docs.hypercubic.ai/core-concepts/the-terminal\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn more<!-- -->&nbsp;<span></span></a></div><div><p><img alt=\"Hopper TN3270 terminal in manual mode — ISPF editor browsing a CICS COBOL program with the agent panel collapsed\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1797\" height=\"1377\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 60vw\" srcset=\"https://www.hypercubic.ai/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhopper%2Fhopper_manual_mode.jpg&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, https://www.hypercubic.ai/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhopper%2Fhopper_manual_mode.jpg&amp;w=320&amp;q=75 320w, https://www.hypercubic.ai/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhopper%2Fhopper_manual_mode.jpg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, https://www.hypercubic.ai/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhopper%2Fhopper_manual_mode.jpg&amp;w=480&amp;q=75 480w, https://www.hypercubic.ai/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhopper%2Fhopper_manual_mode.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, https://www.hypercubic.ai/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhopper%2Fhopper_manual_mode.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, https://www.hypercubic.ai/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhopper%2Fhopper_manual_mode.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, https://www.hypercubic.ai/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhopper%2Fhopper_manual_mode.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, https://www.hypercubic.ai/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhopper%2Fhopper_manual_mode.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, https://www.hypercubic.ai/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhopper%2Fhopper_manual_mode.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, https://www.hypercubic.ai/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhopper%2Fhopper_manual_mode.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, https://www.hypercubic.ai/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhopper%2Fhopper_manual_mode.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"https://www.hypercubic.ai/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fhopper%2Fhopper_manual_mode.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"></p></div></div><div><p><h2>Pricing</h2></p><div><div><h3>Hobby</h3><p>Free</p><p>Includes:</p><ul><li><span>No credit card required</span></li><li><span>macOS, Windows, and Linux</span></li><li><span>Connect to your own mainframe</span></li><li><span>All core Hopper features</span></li></ul></div><div><h3>Enterprise</h3><p>Custom</p><p>Everything in Hobby, plus:</p><ul><li><span>SAML SSO</span></li><li><span>MCP Server Access</span></li><li><span>Admin and Model Controls</span></li><li><span>Org-wide Privacy Controls</span></li><li><span>No Model Training</span></li><li><span>Priority Support</span></li><li><span>On-prem / VPC Deployment</span></li><li><span>SOC 2 &amp; Pen Test Reports</span></li></ul></div></div></div><div><div><h2>Join our community</h2><p>Connect with builders using Hopper, follow product updates, and swap ideas with the Hypercubic team.</p></div><a href=\"https://discord.gg/NRD4N7X6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>Join our Discord</span></a></div><div id=\"downloads\"><p><h2>Download Hopper, connect to your LPAR, and start shipping</h2></p><div><div><h3>Windows</h3></div><ul><li><a href=\"https://d3frg5t9nh6rud.cloudfront.net/latest/Hopper-1.1.4-win-x64.exe\" download=\"\"><span></span></a></li></ul></div></div></div></div>",
